{"id":"4bbf6d604961cbb2","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-fhodtt-satisfaction.md","title":"类型的语义可居留性","display":"df-fhodtt-satisfaction — 类型的语义可居留性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-fhodtt-satisfaction","aliases":["16-df-fhodtt-satisfaction","FHoDTT satisfaction"],"display":"df-fhodtt-satisfaction — 类型的语义可居留性","depends_on":["[[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]]","[[16-df-comprehension-with-unit]]"],"source":"§11.6, Definitions 11.6.1–11.6.2; §10.4, terms as sections","revision_date":"2026-10-19"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-fhodtt-satisfaction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-fhodtt-satisfaction</span><span>FHoDTT satisfaction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fhodtt-satisfaction — 类型的语义可居留性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f94e7143755d4851\" href=\"?note=f94e7143755d4851\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-cat-model\">16-df-fhodtt-cat-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ef7c23f9a9f13d7\" href=\"?note=7ef7c23f9a9f13d7\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-with-unit\">16-df-comprehension-with-unit</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§11.6, Definitions 11.6.1–11.6.2; §10.4, terms as sections"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FHoDTTModel}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{FHoDTTModel}(M)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为类型纤维化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_q\">\\(T_q\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi X\">\\(\\chi X\\)</span> 的单位终对象函子。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>给定语境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 和其中的类型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的良定义解释，记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=⟦\\Gamma⟧_M\\in\\mathcal B\">\\(I=⟦\\Gamma⟧_M\\in\\mathcal B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=⟦ A⟧_M\\in\\mathcal D_I\">\\(a=⟦ A⟧_M\\in\\mathcal D_I\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>严格版本使用同一依赖文件的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}(S)\\)</span> 及其已递归构造的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf C_S,\\mathsf A^s_S\">\\(\\mathsf C_S,\\mathsf A^s_S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 良构且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Type}\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Type}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3930e297a315728a\" href=\"?note=3930e297a315728a\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-terms\">16-df-fhodtt-terms</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\models^{\\mathrm{spl}}_\\Gamma A\">\\(S\\models^{\\mathrm{spl}}_\\Gamma A\\)</span> 是下文另外定义的关系，不对普通记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 预设一套未给出的语法解释。 含部分值的合取由左向右求值：只有前置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\downarrow\">\\(\\downarrow\\)</span> 守卫成立时，才求值后继含该值的式子。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fhodtt\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\\quad M\\models_\\Gamma A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal D_I(T_qI,a)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fhodtt\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\\quad M\\models_\\Gamma A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal D_I(T_qI,a)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\models^{\\mathrm{spl}}_\\Gamma A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma)\\downarrow\\land\n\\mathsf A^{\\mathsf{Type}}_S(\\Gamma,A)\\downarrow\\land\n\\operatorname{Tm}^{S}_{\\mathsf{Type}}(\n\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma),\\mathsf A^{\\mathsf{Type}}_S(\\Gamma,A))\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\models^{\\mathrm{spl}}_\\Gamma A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma)\\downarrow\\land\n\\mathsf A^{\\mathsf{Type}}_S(\\Gamma,A)\\downarrow\\land\n\\operatorname{Tm}^{S}_{\\mathsf{Type}}(\n\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma),\\mathsf A^{\\mathsf{Type}}_S(\\Gamma,A))\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>右侧要求类型有一个垂直语义项；类型纤维一般不是预序，不能无条件写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\\leq A\">\\(\\top\\leq A\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>此条件只定义语义可居留性，不宣称每个语义项都由句法项定义，也不是一个单独 Prop 层的真值谓词。</li>\n<li>严格版本的可靠性与完备性采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7b655ef4974b8266\" href=\"?note=7b655ef4974b8266\" title=\"16-thm-fhodtt-soundness\">16-thm-fhodtt-soundness</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"32520a37e4beb365\" href=\"?note=32520a37e4beb365\" title=\"16-thm-fhodtt-completeness\">16-thm-fhodtt-completeness</a> 的实际递归解释及句法商证明；普通版本仍只对前提中给定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,a\">\\(I,a\\)</span> 定义纤维项的存在性。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，§11.6, Definitions 11.6.1–11.6.2; §10.4, terms as sections。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-cat-model","status":"resolved","id":"f94e7143755d4851","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-with-unit","status":"resolved","id":"7ef7c23f9a9f13d7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-comprehension-with-unit]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-terms","status":"resolved","id":"3930e297a315728a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"严格版本使用同一依赖文件的 $\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}(S)$ 及其已递归构造的 $\\mathsf C_S,\\mathsf A^s_S$；$\\Gamma$ 良构且 $\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Type}$ 采用 [[16-df-fhodtt-terms]]。$S\\models^{\\mathrm{spl}}_\\Gamma A$ 是下文另外定义的关系，不对普通记录 $M$ 预设一套未给出的语法解释。 含部分值的合取由左向右求值：只有前置 $\\downarrow$ 守卫成立时，才求值后继含该值的式子。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-fhodtt-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"7b655ef4974b8266","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"严格版本的可靠性与完备性采用 [[16-thm-fhodtt-soundness]]、[[16-thm-fhodtt-completeness]] 的实际递归解释及句法商证明；普通版本仍只对前提中给定的 $I,a$ 定义纤维项的存在性。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-fhodtt-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"32520a37e4beb365","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"严格版本的可靠性与完备性采用 [[16-thm-fhodtt-soundness]]、[[16-thm-fhodtt-completeness]] 的实际递归解释及句法商证明；普通版本仍只对前提中给定的 $I,a$ 定义纤维项的存在性。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{FHoDTTModel}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"T_q","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi X","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"I=⟦\\Gamma⟧_M\\in\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"a=⟦ A⟧_M\\in\\mathcal D_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf C_S,\\mathsf A^s_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Type}","display":false},{"tex":"S\\models^{\\mathrm{spl}}_\\Gamma A","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\downarrow","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fhodtt\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\\quad M\\models_\\Gamma A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal D_I(T_qI,a)\\ne\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"S\\models^{\\mathrm{spl}}_\\Gamma A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma)\\downarrow\\land\n\\mathsf A^{\\mathsf{Type}}_S(\\Gamma,A)\\downarrow\\land\n\\operatorname{Tm}^{S}_{\\mathsf{Type}}(\n\\mathsf C_S(\\Gamma),\\mathsf A^{\\mathsf{Type}}_S(\\Gamma,A))\\ne\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\top\\leq A","display":false},{"tex":"I,a","display":false}],"bytes":2262,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-218","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-fhodtt-satisfaction|df-fhodtt-satisfaction — 类型的语义可居留性]]"},{"id":"32520a37e4beb365","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}(S)$ 及其递归解释采用 [[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]]；$S\\models^{\\mathrm{spl}}_\\Gamma A$ 采用 [[16-df-fhodtt-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"7b655ef4974b8266","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S\\models^{\\mathrm{spl}}_\\Gamma A$ 采用 [[16-df-fhodtt-satisfaction]]。模型量词遍历足够大宇宙中的严格记录，不把一般普通泛对象模型替换成分裂模型，也不把可导判断的有效性纳入模型公理。式中的每个模式对其显示参数分别普遍闭包；其中 $\\sigma:\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\Gamma$ 表示已给出的替换判断。"}],"outgoing":["f94e7143755d4851","7ef7c23f9a9f13d7","3930e297a315728a","7b655ef4974b8266","32520a37e4beb365"]}